@Bitcoin Along with Bitcoin, Nasdaq recently filed an application with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for the listing of 21 Shares' Dogecoin ETFs.
A decision on the ETF is scheduled for June 17. 
If ETF Is Approved, Dogecoin Is Expected To Surge. Up To $3

@dogecoin Recently, Nasdaq filed an application with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to list 21 Shares' Dogecoin ETFs.
A decision on the ETF is scheduled for June 17. 
If the ETF is approved, Dogecoin is expected to soar, it said.
